Z||000000||mrfixit58||10-15-2001||05:13 PM||||Just an idea, or rather, a recommendation...<P>I assume everyone here uses a short cut to get to Pennock's, right? But, not everyone is using the "Private E-mail" feature that Cliff has so graciously included. I have used it several times and find it real convenient when wanting to discuss something with another member but not wanting to waste everyone else's time.<P>Unfortunately, not everyone else checks their "Inbox" on a regular basis. So, here is the recommendation (most have already figured this part out by now) why not change your shortcut to go directly to the Private e-mail Login page? That way, you'll check your e-mail box first.<P>You have to login anyway to post so... as Nike says... Just Do It!<P>What'ca think?<BR>||||reg||3
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||10-15-2001||05:39 PM||||My shortcut goes directly to the Forum List Page... which shows how many Private Messages you have in your box, as well as if there are any new messages (if your computer stores your login).  I just go whatever direction from there!||||reg||1
